Class D image trial - behavioral control, approximate power devices
* Image: NE555 -> LM358 PWM -> IR2110 -> IRF640 half bridge -> LC
* Assumptions: VIN=24V, 4 ohm, 10 W rated speaker represented by resistive load, 1kHz input, 0.6V peak.
* Missing bootstrap values: C2=100nF, C3=10uF.
* 555 timing R1=2.2k, C12=1n: frequency estimated 1/(2*ln(2)*R*C).
* Triangle replaces curved 555 timing waveform; comparator/driver idealized.
* MOSFET model below is an approximation, NOT a vendor IRF640 model.
.param FS=327885 FIN=1k AMP=0.6
Vbus vin 0 24
Vlogic v5 0 5
Vdriver v12 0 12
Va audio 0 SINE(0 {AMP} {FIN})
Boffset mod 0 V=2.5+V(audio)
B555 carrier 0 V=5/3+(5/3)*(1-abs(2*(time*FS-floor(time*FS))-1))
Bcompare pwm 0 V=if(V(mod)>V(carrier),5,0)
* RC plus thresholds approximates break-before-make gate timing.
Rtim pwm cmd 1k
Ctim cmd 0 30p
Dboot v12 vb Dfast
C2 vb vs 100n
C3 vb vs 10u IC=11.3
BHO ho vs V=if(V(cmd)>4,limit(V(vb,vs),0,12),0)
BLO lo 0 V=if(V(cmd)<1,12,0)
R8 ho gh 10
R9 lo gl 10
D2 gh ho Dfast
D3 gl lo Dfast
M1 vin gh vs vs PowerApprox
M2 vs gl 0 0 PowerApprox
L1 vs out 26u Rser=0.05
C11 out 0 1u
Rload out 0 4
.model Dfast D(Is=10n Rs=0.1 N=1.5 Cjo=20p Tt=50n)
.model PowerApprox VDMOS(Vto=4 Kp=8 Rd=0.10 Rs=0.04 Rg=2 Cgdmax=400p Cgdmin=50p Cgs=1.2n Cjo=300p Is=1n Rb=0.1)
.tran 0 12m 0 50n
.options plotwinsize=0
.save I(Vbus) I(Vdriver) I(Vlogic) V(demod_sin) V(demod_cos) V(audio) V(mod) V(carrier) V(pwm) V(vs) V(out) V(gh,vs) V(gl) V(vb,vs) I(Rload)
.meas tran output_dc AVG V(out) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran output_rms RMS V(out) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran total_load_power AVG (V(out)*I(Rload)) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran output_min MIN V(out) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran output_max MAX V(out) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran bootstrap_min MIN V(vb,vs) FROM 8m TO 12m
Bsin demod_sin 0 V=V(out)*sin(2*pi*FIN*time)
Bcos demod_cos 0 V=V(out)*cos(2*pi*FIN*time)
.meas tran audio_sin INTEG V(demod_sin) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran audio_cos INTEG V(demod_cos) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran fundamental_peak PARAM 2*sqrt(audio_sin**2+audio_cos**2)/0.004
.meas tran audio_power PARAM fundamental_peak**2/(2*4)
.meas tran bus_current_avg AVG (-I(Vbus)) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran bus_current_rms RMS I(Vbus) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran bus_current_peak MAX (-I(Vbus)) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran driver_current_avg AVG (-I(Vdriver)) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran logic_current_avg AVG (-I(Vlogic)) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran bus_power PARAM 24*bus_current_avg
.meas tran modeled_input_power PARAM bus_power+12*driver_current_avg+5*logic_current_avg
.meas tran output_pp PARAM output_max-output_min
.meas tran fundamental_pp PARAM 2*fundamental_peak
.meas tran voltage_gain PARAM fundamental_peak/0.6
.meas tran gain_db PARAM 20*ln(fundamental_peak/0.6)/ln(10)
.meas tran audio_efficiency_percent PARAM 100*audio_power/modeled_input_power
.meas tran load_efficiency_percent PARAM 100*total_load_power/modeled_input_power
.meas tran dc_load_power PARAM output_dc**2/4
.meas tran ac_load_power PARAM total_load_power-dc_load_power
.meas tran speaker_current_rms RMS I(Rload) FROM 8m TO 12m
.meas tran speaker_current_dc AVG I(Rload) FROM 8m TO 12m
.end




